      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's good. It's professional and hits the right notes. Can you try another version though? This one feels a bit stiff. Maybe make it sound a little more \"human\" and warm, like we're genuinely sorry for the mishap, without losing that luxury brand feel. It shouldn't be too wordy, just a bit more sincere about the error at the hub.",
